00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:51.750
- Thank you for having me.

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:53.070
- Of course.

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:56.130
Our second guest is Dr. Kerry Ressler.

00:01:56.130 --> 00:01:59.000
Dr. Ressler is a scientist and a physician

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.250
