to talk about these things

00:40:52.620 --> 00:40:53.570
only in a bubble.

00:40:53.570 --> 00:40:55.240
So I'm thinking about
all the other components

00:40:55.240 --> 00:40:57.180
that contribute to emotional wellness

00:40:57.180 --> 00:40:58.750
and to mental health challenges

00:40:58.750 --> 00:41:01.060
and to come in through those
mental health challenges.

00:41:01.060 --> 00:41:03.150
