components, you know

00:41:03.150 --> 00:41:05.220
the social justice, racism,

00:41:05.220 --> 00:41:06.213
all the different interventions we have,

00:41:06.213 --> 00:41:08.980
whether that be
psychological interventions,

00:41:08.980 --> 00:41:10.080
prayer and meditation,

00:41:10.080 --> 00:41:12.300
and how all of these things impinge.

00:41:12.300 --> 00:41:13.960
So I think it's always good for us to have

00:41:13.960 --> 00:41:15.420
as you both mentioned that focus,

00:41:15.420 --> 00:41:16.270
but I'm curious

00:41:16.270 --> 00:41:17.670
well you've both talked about this already

00:41:17.670 --> 00:41:19.480
