reason why this might happen.

00:43:07.640 --> 00:43:11.100
We think about if a
mouse grew up in one part

00:43:11.100 --> 00:43:11.933
from parent, you know

00:43:11.933 --> 00:43:14.450
they might have enough
smell systems to be able to

00:43:14.450 --> 00:43:16.490
smell 10,000 different odors,

00:43:16.490 --> 00:43:17.510
but there may only be 50

00:43:17.510 --> 00:43:18.670
