00:43:44.488 --> 00:43:45.321
(Kerry chuckles)

00:43:45.321 --> 00:43:48.830
And they're not always
what we consciously want.

00:43:48.830 --> 00:43:52.020
They're what our brain,
because of our DNA,

00:43:52.020 --> 00:43:55.230
our epigenetics and our
lifetime experiences

00:43:55.230 --> 00:43:56.720
emotionally have us respond to.

00:43:56.720 --> 00:43:58.790
And sometimes that's
really helpful, that gut.

00:43:58.790 --> 00:44:00.900
And other times, it can
keep getting us stuck

00:44:00.900 --> 00:44:03.070
